  "description": "<p>⭐ <em>The Jazz Room presents a rich and heartfelt tribute to Marvin Gaye, one of the most iconic voices in soul music. Grab a drink, settle in, and relive his greatest hits as a brilliant live band brings them to life. Get your tickets for <strong>The Jazz Room: Marvin Gaye in a Night of Soul </strong>in </em><em>London!</em></p>\n\n<p><strong>Highlights</strong><br>\n🌟 Celebrate a timeless artist whose voice helped define the soul genre<br>\n🎵 Enjoy Marvin’s most iconic songs reimagined in a powerful live tribute concert<br>\n❤️ Explore his immeasurable impact on music, culture, and society<br>\n🍷 Hosted in a chic, intimate venue, perfect for a night of music and connection<br>\n🎁 Gift memories to someone special! Purchase a gift card for <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.feverup.com/m/502064\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The Jazz Room</a> here</p>\n\n<p><strong>General Info</strong><br>\n📅 Dates and times: select your date &amp; time directly in the ticket selector<br>\n⏳ Duration: 1 hour<br>\n📍 Location: Phoenix Arts Club<br>\n👤 Age requirement: 18+<br>\n♿ Accessibility: the venue is wheelchair accessible<br>\n🪑 Please note: tables are shared and seating is assigned on a first-come, first-served basis within each zone<br>\n❓ Please consult the FAQs of this experience <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/e/2PACX-1vRNs1ceLfIyxrPVFiYPmbtc7JwOTjBaugRUm9I2KKMv3-_GiE6-5HTGytCKCy5mz5ZlpAwyONiajxfm/pub\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">here</a><br>\n✨ If you would like to book a private show or buy tickets for a large group (30+ people), click <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://thejazzroomexperience.com/groups/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></p>\n\n<p><strong>Program</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Let's Get It On</li>\n\t<li>I Heard It Through The Grapevine</li>\n\t<li>Ain't No Mountain High Enough</li>\n\t<li>What's Going on?</li>\n\t<li>How Sweet It Is (To Be Loved By You)</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>…and many more</p>\n\n<p><strong>Description</strong><br>\nThe Jazz Room invites you to honor the legacy of Marvin Gaye in a special tribute edition. Famous for his silky, hypnotic vocals and unmistakable emotional depth, Marvin remains one of the most influential soul artists of all time. This live concert takes you through his most beloved songs, capturing the spirit and heart of his music. More than a performance, it’s an extraordinary celebration of a voice that still moves audiences across the world. Get your tickets for <em>The Jazz Room: Marvin Gaye in a Night of Soul </em>in&nbsp;London!</p>\n\n<p><strong>Seating Map</strong></p>\n\n<center><img src=\"https://images.feverup.com/plan/photo/f5934674-9264-11f0-92e1-2e30c2207dfb.png\" width=\"290px\"></center>",
